1
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,000
Uncle.

2
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:50,289
Are you still thinking about Feng Xue?

3
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,520
Yes.

4
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,520
I want to help her,

5
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:54,160
but I can't think of a way.

6
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:56,530
Don't worry.

7
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:59,360
Sister Long will definitely take care of this.

8
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,090
Stop wiping.

9
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:01,440
Go back to sleep.

10
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:02,720
Save your brainpower.

11
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:04,360
You still have to prepare for the exam.

12
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:04,960
Okay.

13
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,480
Go to sleep.

14
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:07,930
Stop thinking about it.

15
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:15,160
Huzi.

16
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:16,640
Help me move this.

17
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:17,960
Where to?

18
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,620
What's wrong, Mom?

19
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,660
What happened?

20
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,370
My back. What happened?

21
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,760
You sprained your back.

22
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:24,640
Let's go to the hospital.

23
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:25,280
I'll go get the car.

24
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,680
I'll back the car up.

25
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,560
Slow down.

26
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,480
Don't move.

27
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:31,810
If it hurts, don't move.

28
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,400
Your lumbar disc herniation

29
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,400
is quite serious.

30
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,260
Why did you wait until now to come?

31
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,079
We run a bathhouse.

32
00:02:39,079 --> 00:02:40,640
We can't leave it unattended.

33
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:41,520
Let me tell you.

34
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:44,240
Your back can't stay in a damp place all the time.

35
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:48,320
If you don't want it to get worse, you'd better change your environment.

36
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:49,160
Understood, doctor.

37
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,960
Just do whatever needs to be done.

38
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:51,720
Prescribe medicine if needed.

39
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:52,780
Operate if needed.

40
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,120
What operation?

41
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:56,720
Just prescribe some medicine.

42
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:58,880
I'll be fine after applying patches and sleeping for a couple of days.

43
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:00,000
Then I'll prescribe some medicine first,

44
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,660
and you can do some physical therapy for a while.

45
00:03:04,040 --> 00:03:06,680
Will health insurance cover the physical therapy?

46
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:08,440
You have to get treated whether it's covered or not.

47
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:09,970
What are you talking about?

48
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:10,720
Just leave it alone.

49
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,720
Doctor, don't listen to her.

50
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:13,360
Just do whatever needs to be done.

51
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:13,840
Sorry for the trouble.

52
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,440
Okay.

53
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,440
Please wait a moment.

54
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,120
Okay.

55
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:16,880
Thank you.

56
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:20,400
It's not a big deal.

57
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,600
I'll be fine after applying patches for a couple of days.

58
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:24,730
If health insurance doesn't cover it,

59
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,620
it'll be quite expensive.

60
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,880
So expensive.

61
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:36,880
Why does it cost 580,000?

62
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,960
It shouldn't be.

63
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:53,000
Logically, I should be quite lucky.

64
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,840
There's no problem.

65
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:12,320
Daquan, did you see the message in the group?

66
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:14,920
The group leader said Wangang's stock will definitely go up.

67
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:15,780
Is it reliable?

68
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,240
It's reliable.

69
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:22,680
The group leader said there's inside information, so it's absolutely accurate.

70
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,940
Brother Hu, hurry up and buy it tomorrow.

71
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,000
After finishing the evaluation,

72
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,880
Lawyer Li said your project has huge legal risks.

73
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,020
Let's just drop it.

74
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,200
If this project doesn't work out,

75
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:40,800
there's always the next one.

76
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:42,480
Li Xin, right?

77
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,760
Don't cause trouble.

78
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:46,080
You haven't been in the group for long.

79
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:47,800
You haven't found your footing yet.

80
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,120
Market experience is not something

81
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:51,400
you can learn in a short time.

82
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:53,860
How about this?

83
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,940
I'll find something for you to do.

84
00:04:57,240 --> 00:05:00,480
The marketing department recently acquired a bathhouse.

85
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,140
I'll leave it to you to manage.

86
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:04,020
Use it for practice first.

87
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:07,460
If you do well, we'll consider the next step.

88
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,800
Hello, Mr. Wan.

89
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,240
Come, say hello to Brother Hu.

90
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,400
Hello, Brother Hu.

91
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:31,960
What is this place?

92
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,600
Is this a shop?

93
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:37,200
This is too big.

94
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,520
It feels so empty.

95
00:05:41,159 --> 00:05:42,360
There's even an echo.

96
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:43,130
Shout again.

97
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:49,159
It's too big.

98
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:50,520
How is it?

99
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,800
Is the law firm busy lately?

100
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:54,040
It's okay. I'm planning to expand a bit,

101
00:05:54,159 --> 00:05:55,890
and develop some new business.

102
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,850
How much can you make a month there?

103
00:05:58,520 --> 00:06:00,120
About eight to ten thousand.

104
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:02,320
Really?

105
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,760
Sometimes.

106
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,650
Come work for me.

107
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,400
What would I do here?

108
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:11,240
Mix drinks?

109
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,840
What do you mean, mix drinks?

110
00:06:12,880 --> 00:06:14,680
This place will be yours.

111
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:16,840
You'll manage the whole bathhouse.

112
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:19,200
Doesn't your family run a bathhouse?

113
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,960
You have experience. No problem.

114
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,640
My family's is called a public bath.

115
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:25,280
Besides, the law firm can't do without me right now.

116
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:27,340
What? Is the law firm partner a woman?

117
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,530
Are you trying to hit on her?

118
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:32,600
Look at you.

119
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:35,040
Your thoughts are so dirty.

120
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,640
We are totally incompatible.

121
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:37,680
Come work for me.

122
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:39,560
I'll give you 500,000 a year,

123
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,600
with a 10% increase every year after.

124
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,920
You can also get an advance.

125
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,650
How about it?

126
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:45,480
500,000?

127
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:47,360
Stop kidding around.

128
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,640
With such a big business,

129
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:50,360
aren't you going to watch it yourself?

130
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,290
I have more important things to do.

131
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:53,960
So,

132
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:56,360
I need to find someone I trust to keep an eye on it for me.

133
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:58,440
Then you trust me a bit too much.

134
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,440
Do you remember?

135
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:01,080
Back when I dropped out of technical school,

136
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:03,040
I was cornered in a dead end by a bunch of jerks,

137
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,440
and beaten half to death.

138
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,280
You were such a timid guy,

139
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:09,050
but you risked your life to save me.

140
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:10,570
All by yourself.

141
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,960
If I don't trust you, who would I trust?

142
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:15,200
The main thing was that if I didn't take that path,

143
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,080
I couldn't go home.

144
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,600
What? Are you embarrassed

145
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:18,680
that you were nice to me?

146
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,400
Okay.

147
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,280
As long as you keep it in your heart.

148
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:20,960
Come on, it's all in the drink.

149
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:21,640
No.

150
00:07:21,640 --> 00:07:23,360
Do you think I can enjoy this all by myself?

151
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,760
I have to bring you along.

152
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:27,680
What's wrong?

153
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:29,780
This is too strong.

154
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:32,000
What kind of liquor is this?

155
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,200
Still the same.

156
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,640
Daquan, this...

157
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:57,000
Why did all these stocks hit the limit down?

158
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,480
I can't even sell them.

159
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,000
I don't know.

160
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:04,930
I'm trapped too.

161
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,050
What's going on?

162
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:09,960
Did you all see it?

163
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,440
The official website has debunked the rumor.

164
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,840
The news about entering the new energy sector

165
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:14,520
was purely fake.

166
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:16,240
The person who spread it is a total scammer.

167
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:16,960
Brother Hu,

168
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:17,720
later,

169
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,240
you really have to be our representative

170
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,840
and talk it out with the lawyer.

171
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:22,080
I know you don't want

172
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:23,960
the people at your law firm to know about this.

173
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:24,520
So,

174
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:26,280
we found another law firm.

175
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:29,080
Among all the guys in this car, you know the law best.

176
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:30,400
You really have to help us.

177
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:31,840
Yeah, please.

178
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:32,600
Okay, okay. I'll...

179
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:34,240
I... I'll do my best, alright?

180
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:36,100
Thank you, Brother Hu. Thank you.

181
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,919
We're here. This is it.

182
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:42,130
The biggest law firm in Leyang.

183
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:45,400
This is Honghu.

184
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:50,080
Just wait.

185
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:52,880
Brother Hu is already here.

186
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,120
What's the rush?

187
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,360
The lawyer will be here soon.

188
00:08:58,360 --> 00:09:00,920
We'll ask him what's going on when he arrives.

189
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:05,080
Ms. Guo, long time no see.

190
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:06,600
Come, this way please.

191
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,850
Brother Hu, what are you doing?

192
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:12,600
Lawyer Li.

193
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:14,980
Lawyer Li is finally here.

194
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:17,400
We've been waiting for you, Mr. Li.

195
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:18,920
We are here for a consultation.

196
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:20,920
May I ask who is the representative?

197
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:22,640
The representative? It's Brother Hu.

198
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:23,800
Brother Hu. Hu.

199
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:25,440
Brother Hu.

200
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:26,080
Yes.

201
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,040
We sent a representative.

202
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:28,040
We were afraid we couldn't explain it clearly,

203
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:29,640
so we let him talk to you. Brother Hu!

204
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:30,360
Right.

205
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:32,080
You have to stand up for us.

206
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,220
He's crippled.

207
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,960
Isn't this Beihu?

208
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,200
How did he become a gecko?

209
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:45,740
Let's talk.

210
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:52,760
I thought your office would be trimmed with gold.

211
00:09:52,760 --> 00:09:54,160
It looks quite ordinary.

212
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:57,000
Take a note.

213
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:59,860
Tell me, how much did you invest in total?

214
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,120
Over 500,000.

215
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,040
Over 500,000?

216
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:04,480
How much did you lose?

217
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,160
I lost over 200,000.

218
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:06,960
Over 200,000?

219
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:09,640
Where did you get so much money? Did you take out a loan?

220
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,500
Can you ask something important?

221
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:13,880
How did you join the group?

222
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:14,640
Someone added me.

223
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:15,640
He got stuck too.

224
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,400
What did the group admin say?

225
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:19,480
He said he had insider information.

226
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,360
He said Wangang...

227
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:22,360
They are about to enter the new energy industry.

228
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,880
And they even got a foreign patent.

229
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:25,680
The stock will definitely go up.

230
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:29,640
Did he say where he got this inside information?

231
00:10:29,640 --> 00:10:31,360
Who knows? No one asked.

232
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,760
He just said he had inside information.

233
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:33,640
And you just believed him?

234
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:34,720
Well, he told me...

235
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:37,000
Can you stop interrogating me?

236
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:37,800
Just tell me,

237
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,520
can I sue this guy or not?

238
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:41,600
No.

239
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:44,400
Insider trading is illegal to begin with.

240
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:46,280
Then I can at least get my money back, right?

241
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:47,200
Even less so.

242
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:49,040
Illegal losses cannot be recovered.

243
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:50,280
Then what have you been talking to me about all this time?

244
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:51,240
Are you messing with me?

245
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,680
You came to me for a consultation.

246
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:54,200
Don't I have to understand the situation first?

247
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,480
So your solution for me

248
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,600
is that it can't be solved?

249
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:59,330
That's why I won't charge you a consultation fee.

250
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:01,600
Leave me your contact info.

251
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,800
I'll ask you if anything comes up later.

252
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,200
You can't solve it.

253
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,800
Why do you want my contact info?

254
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:07,960
Are you trying to hit on me?

255
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,160
My contacts are full.

256
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:17,280
Don't tell anyone about this.

257
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,660
Is this how you ask for a favor?

258
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:22,280
Fine, Li Xin, you win.

259
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:24,200
I'm betting on your character.

260
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,760
You're not one to gossip.

261
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:32,280
Director.

262
00:11:33,640 --> 00:11:36,440
I suspect Wangang's information has been leaked.

263
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:38,440
Mr. Wan.

264
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:45,200
Li Xin.

265
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:49,120
Are Honghu's confidentiality measures made of paper?

266
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:51,720
Wangang's inside information is flying everywhere.

267
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,560
The group's stock price has been affected.

268
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:54,820
What do you have to say?

269
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,000
Regarding the leak,

270
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,720
we are already investigating.

271
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:02,360
You just issued the evaluation report last week,

272
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:04,920
and the stock price fluctuated the next day.

273
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:06,240
How will you investigate?

274
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:07,360
Investigate yourselves?

275
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,280
But Mr. Wan,

276
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,480
we are not

277
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:11,120
the only ones who viewed the project materials.

278
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,400
I've already checked.

279
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,760
There are no issues with Wangang.

280
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:17,000
Now I want you

281
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,600
to list all Honghu personnel

282
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:20,600
involved in the Wangang project

283
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:21,640
for me.

284
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:22,740
