00:24:14,080 --> 00:24:15,360
He's all bundled up.

569
00:24:15,360 --> 00:24:16,120
Is this the guy?

570
00:24:16,120 --> 00:24:16,800
That's him.

571
00:24:16,800 --> 00:24:18,240
There are other angles in the video.

572
00:24:18,240 --> 00:24:18,920
Look.

573
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:20,640
His computer screen shows

574
00:24:20,640 --> 00:24:23,700
the website where the insider information was posted.

575
00:24:24,120 --> 00:24:26,760
Look, this person is wearing a ring on his left ring finger.

576
00:24:26,760 --> 00:24:27,640
He's married.

577
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:30,760
His phone lit up.

578
00:24:32,080 --> 00:24:35,280
I think I've seen this phone wallpaper somewhere before.

579
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:40,400
That Lawyer Han behind me

580
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:42,610
is really from Lawyer Shen's team.

581
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:45,800
This matter

582
00:24:46,840 --> 00:24:48,900
is indeed Honghu's responsibility.

583
00:24:50,040 --> 00:24:51,680
The lawyer involved, Han Song,

584
00:24:51,680 --> 00:24:52,920
has already been fired by us.

585
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:55,400
The judicial authorities will also revoke his law license.

586
00:24:55,400 --> 00:24:57,000
The police will also open an investigation

587
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:59,080
and hold him criminally responsible.

588
00:24:59,080 --> 00:24:59,810
In addition,

589
00:25:00,840 --> 00:25:02,000
our law firm

590
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:05,840
is willing to waive half of next year's consulting fee

591
00:25:05,840 --> 00:25:06,760
as an apology.

592
00:25:06,840 --> 00:25:08,960
Director, Mr. Wan,

593
00:25:09,360 --> 00:25:11,490
it is indeed my poor judgment in hiring

594
00:25:11,760 --> 00:25:13,290
and failure in leadership.

595
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:16,000
I am willing to take full responsibility.

596
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:17,020
Attorney Shen.

597
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:18,240
From now on,

598
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:21,760
you will withdraw from all matters related to Wangang

599
00:25:21,760 --> 00:25:23,400
and hand them over to Lawyer Li's team.

600
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,360
Director,

601
00:25:24,640 --> 00:25:27,720
there's no need for collective punishment over such a small matter.

602
00:25:27,720 --> 00:25:29,200
If we're talking about collective punishment,

603
00:25:29,200 --> 00:25:32,240
then the entire Honghu should also be punished,

604
00:25:32,360 --> 00:25:33,080
right?

605
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:34,800
This matter

606
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:35,680
is not exactly small,

607
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:37,000
but not too big either.

608
00:25:38,280 --> 00:25:40,960
I think it's better to turn big problems into small ones

609
00:25:40,960 --> 00:25:43,040
and small ones into nothing. Let it go.

610
00:25:43,040 --> 00:25:45,280
Mr. Wan, you are magnanimous.

611
00:25:45,840 --> 00:25:48,480
But we have to take it seriously.

612
00:25:49,440 --> 00:25:51,200
Why so serious?

613
00:25:51,520 --> 00:25:53,600
We are all good friends.

614
00:25:54,680 --> 00:25:55,440
Friends.

615
00:25:55,720 --> 00:25:58,320
Friends should help each other.

616
00:25:59,320 --> 00:26:02,200
It's good for everyone.

617
00:26:03,720 --> 00:26:04,240
Right?

618
00:26:04,800 --> 00:26:05,600
Right, right.

619
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:10,040
Lawyer Li.

620
00:26:12,280 --> 00:26:13,280
What do you think?

621
00:26:16,520 --> 00:26:18,450
Mr. Wan, regarding your decision,

622
00:26:18,880 --> 00:26:21,080
do I still need to inform President Wan?

623
00:26:26,880 --> 00:26:28,080
For such a small matter,

624
00:26:28,080 --> 00:26:31,210
there's no need for President Wan to decide personally.

625
00:26:31,760 --> 00:26:32,440
What?

626
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:34,960
Do you think my words carry no weight?

627
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:39,320
Well,

628
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:41,000
for this matter,

629
00:26:41,120 --> 00:26:43,520
let's just follow Mr. Wan's instructions.

630
00:26:43,960 --> 00:26:45,240
But Lawyer Shen,

631
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:46,960
keep your team in check.

632
00:26:46,960 --> 00:26:47,760
Of course.

633
00:26:48,360 --> 00:26:49,560
Thank you, Director,

634
00:26:49,560 --> 00:26:50,820
and thank you, Mr. Wan.

635
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:53,440
I definitely won't betray your trust.

636
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:55,280
Fighting!

637
00:26:57,600 --> 00:26:58,520
Handsome.

638
00:27:00,280 --> 00:27:01,120
Mr. Wan,

639
00:27:01,760 --> 00:27:03,200
say hello to President Wan for me.

640
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:03,920
Okay.

641
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:29,570
What are you hiding for?

642
00:27:30,680 --> 00:27:31,940
Think you can run away?

643
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:34,280
You really know how to pick a spot.

644
00:27:34,280 --> 00:27:35,740
Hiding in a dump like this.

645
00:27:35,840 --> 00:27:36,920
I'm telling you,

646
00:27:36,960 --> 00:27:38,280
you don't need to follow.

647
00:27:38,280 --> 00:27:38,920
Mom.

648
00:27:39,680 --> 00:27:41,280
My friend wants to talk to me.

649
00:27:41,520 --> 00:27:43,680
Go outside and get some sun first.

650
00:27:44,320 --> 00:27:45,250
Here, slow down.

651
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:58,260
I have 200,000 tied up.

652
00:27:59,400 --> 00:28:00,800
If I can't make up this shortfall,

653
00:28:00,800 --> 00:28:02,930
the bank will take away our bathhouse.

654
00:28:03,280 --> 00:28:04,210
What should I do?

655
00:28:18,880 --> 00:28:20,210
Mom, what are you doing?

656
00:28:20,360 --> 00:28:21,800
Didn't the doctor tell you to rest?

657
00:28:21,800 --> 00:28:23,240
It's fine. It's nothing.

658
00:28:23,240 --> 00:28:23,960
Give it to me.

659
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:24,720
Okay.

660
00:28:24,720 --> 00:28:25,240
I'll do it.

661
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:27,040
Look at how messy your room is.

662
00:28:27,040 --> 00:28:28,480
You don't even tidy it up.

663
00:28:35,320 --> 00:28:36,000
Huzi,

664
00:28:36,440 --> 00:28:38,000
let's buy a house this year.

665
00:28:40,760 --> 00:28:41,800
Why buy a house?

666
00:28:43,320 --> 00:28:44,200
You're a grown man now.

667
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:45,240
You can't always

668
00:28:45,240 --> 00:28:46,880
live in this storage room.

669
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:48,720
You'll have to get a wife sooner or later.

670
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:50,160
I've done the math.

671
00:28:50,160 --> 00:28:52,000
The money I have on hand now

672
00:28:53,040 --> 00:28:53,800
is almost

673
00:28:53,800 --> 00:28:56,520
enough for a down payment on a small two-bedroom apartment.

674
00:28:56,520 --> 00:28:58,120
We can't be picky about the location.

675
00:28:58,120 --> 00:28:59,760
As long as transit is convenient.

676
00:28:59,760 --> 00:29:01,040
As for the monthly mortgage,

677
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:02,520
you don't have to worry too much.

678
00:29:02,520 --> 00:29:04,320
Our small bathhouse's

679
00:29:04,360 --> 00:29:05,520
monthly income

680
00:29:06,600 --> 00:29:07,520
is enough to cover it.

681
00:29:07,520 --> 00:29:08,520
I'm not buying.

682
00:29:08,720 --> 00:29:09,560
Look,

683
00:29:09,560 --> 00:29:10,520
who buys a house now?

684
00:29:10,520 --> 00:29:12,080
Look at how much housing prices have fallen.

685
00:29:12,080 --> 00:29:13,480
What are you talking about?

686
00:29:13,480 --> 00:29:14,600
I'm not going to be a bagholder.

687
00:29:14,600 --> 00:29:16,280
You're over 1.8 meters tall.

688
00:29:16,280 --> 00:29:18,440
You can't even stretch your legs out on this bed.

689
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:19,960
Then I just won't stretch them.

690
00:29:19,960 --> 00:29:21,520
I like to sleep curled up.

691
00:29:21,520 --> 00:29:22,560
Don't worry about it.

692
00:29:22,560 --> 00:29:23,640
Just go back. I'm tired.

693
00:29:23,640 --> 00:29:23,880
Go on.

694
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:27,200
Why do you get sleepy whenever I talk about serious matters?

695
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:27,800
I'm too sleepy.

696
00:29:27,800 --> 00:29:28,840
Is your brain lacking oxygen?

697
00:29:28,840 --> 00:29:30,840
Go, go, go. Follow the doctor's advice.

698
00:29:30,840 --> 00:29:32,770
Think carefully about what I said.

699
00:29:32,800 --> 00:29:33,560
I got it.

700
00:29:33,960 --> 00:29:34,890
Watch your back.

701
00:29:50,080 --> 00:29:51,740
I have 200,000 tied up in this.

702
00:29:52,280 --> 00:29:53,640
What are you going to do about it?

703
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:54,900
I'm worse off than you.

704
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:57,760
I sold my house and car,

705
00:29:58,200 --> 00:30:00,000
and took out a loan for a million.

706
00:30:00,600 --> 00:30:02,200
I have nothing left now.

707
00:30:02,600 --> 00:30:04,080
I'm completely bankrupt.

708
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:06,200
Don't pull that shameless act on me.

709
00:30:06,200 --> 00:30:07,520
Give me a solution.

710
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:11,200
Do whatever you want.

711
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:13,280
Call the police if you want.

712
00:30:13,280 --> 00:30:15,610
If you see anything valuable in this room,

713
00:30:15,800 --> 00:30:16,840
just take it.

714
00:30:17,800 --> 00:30:19,130
I wanted to get rich too.

715
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:20,840
I wanted to prove myself too.

716
00:30:21,560 --> 00:30:23,020
But who would have thought

717
00:30:24,040 --> 00:30:25,640
that in my forties,

718
00:30:27,160 --> 00:30:31,680
I'd still be making my old mother worry about me?

719
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:14,960
Need to file a lawsuit, friend?

720
00:31:14,960 --> 00:31:16,400
We are very professional.

721
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:17,640
Our law firm is very professional.

722
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:18,520
From a law firm.

723
00:31:18,800 --> 00:31:19,840
You can't hand out flyers here.

724
00:31:19,840 --> 00:31:20,840
This way, please.

725
00:31:20,840 --> 00:31:22,040
No, it's not a flyer.

726
00:31:22,040 --> 00:31:23,280
Just making friends.

727
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,840
Any difficulties lately?

728
00:31:24,840 --> 00:31:26,120
Are you looking for a law firm?

729
00:31:26,120 --> 00:31:27,250
Come check out ours.

730
00:31:27,640 --> 00:31:29,040
Are you filing a lawsuit?

731
00:31:31,760 --> 00:31:32,760
Filing a lawsuit, bro?

732
00:31:32,760 --> 00:31:33,600
Are you looking for a lawyer?

733
00:31:33,600 --> 00:31:34,080
No, no, no.

734
00:31:34,080 --> 00:31:34,400
No, no, no.

735
00:31:34,400 --> 00:31:35,400
We specialize in lawsuits.

736
00:31:35,400 --> 00:31:36,130
Really, bro.

737
00:31:36,200 --> 00:31:37,440
Are they not good enough?

738
00:31:37,440 --> 00:31:38,400
We also run a law firm.

739
00:31:38,400 --> 00:31:39,920
Very professional and reasonably priced.

740
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:41,280
You can trust our firm.

741
00:31:41,280 --> 00:31:42,120
Our firm is the most... Right.

742
00:31:42,120 --> 00:31:43,760
Our firm is the most professional on this street.

743
00:31:43,760 --> 00:31:44,280
Which one?

744
00:31:44,280 --> 00:31:45,840
Here, Xiaolongnv Law Firm.

745
00:31:50,600 --> 00:31:51,200
A big case.

746
00:31:51,280 --> 00:31:52,840
This family is very powerful.

747
00:31:52,840 --> 00:31:53,360
Money is not an issue.

748
00:31:53,360 --> 00:31:54,290
What kind of job?

749
00:31:56,640 --> 00:31:57,440
Drug trafficking.

750
00:31:57,440 --> 00:31:58,040
What?

751
00:31:58,280 --> 00:31:59,080
Drug trafficking.

752
00:31:59,080 --> 00:32:00,120
Drug trafficking?

753
00:32:00,120 --> 00:32:01,080
I can't take it.

754
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:02,440
Don't be so quick to reject it.

755
00:32:02,440 --> 00:32:03,960
Listen to their terms first.

756
00:32:03,960 --> 00:32:05,120
It doesn't matter which lawyer takes it.

757
00:32:05,120 --> 00:32:07,360
For every year reduced from the sentence, the reward is 100,000.

758
00:32:07,360 --> 00:32:09,120
If it's a suspended sentence, it's one million.

759
00:32:09,120 --> 00:32:10,400
I wouldn't take it for ten billion.

760
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:12,800
Not taking drug cases is my bottom line and principle.

761
00:32:12,800 --> 00:32:14,800
Why do you have so many bottom lines?

762
00:32:14,800 --> 00:32:15,800
If you keep doing this.

763
00:32:15,800 --> 00:32:17,040
How many years can this law firm survive?

764
00:32:17,040 --> 00:32:18,560
You have a threshold for taking cases.

765
00:32:18,560 --> 00:32:19,760
You give discounts on lawsuits.

766
00:32:19,760 --> 00:32:21,320
And sometimes you even pay out of your own pocket.

767
00:32:21,320 --> 00:32:23,440
How are you going to expand the business like this?

768
00:32:23,440 --> 00:32:25,440
Can't I just expand it slowly?

769
00:32:25,440 --> 00:32:26,360
Dong Beihu, you...

770
00:32:26,360 --> 00:32:27,120
Dong Beihu.

771
00:32:28,360 --> 00:32:29,800
What's wrong, directors?

772
00:32:29,800 --> 00:32:31,480
What's the deal with your law firm?

773
00:32:31,480 --> 00:32:31,920
What's wrong?

774
00:32:31,920 --> 00:32:32,800
This Dong Beihu.

775
00:32:32,800 --> 00:32:33,800
Just now downstairs.

776
00:32:33,800 --> 00:32:34,960
On the entire lawyer street.

777
00:32:34,960 --> 00:32:36,800
He was snatching cases and clients like crazy.

778
00:32:36,800 --> 00:32:39,200
I just got a client and he stole them.

779
00:32:39,280 --> 00:32:40,640
What are you doing? Malicious competition?

780
00:32:40,640 --> 00:32:42,300
Exactly. How could he do this?

781
00:32:42,320 --> 00:32:43,640
Dong Beihu is from your firm.

782
00:32:43,640 --> 00:32:44,840
Are you going to do something about it?

783
00:32:44,840 --> 00:32:46,000
Of course I will.

784
00:32:46,520 --> 00:32:47,160
Well,

785
00:32:47,920 --> 00:32:50,250
hurry up and apologize sincerely. Quick.

786
00:32:52,360 --> 00:32:54,120
Are your old habits acting up again?

787
00:32:54,120 --> 00:32:55,450
Being greedy for money?

788
00:32:55,840 --> 00:32:57,040
Apologize right now.

789
00:33:07,760 --> 00:33:09,520
What's with that attitude? What do you mean?

790
00:33:09,520 --> 00:33:10,580
Stubborn as a mule.

791
00:33:10,720 --> 00:33:12,180
I apologize on his behalf.

792
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:51,740
What are you doing?

793
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:53,120
What are you doing?

794
00:33:53,120 --> 00:33:54,880
A birthday gift. Here.

795
00:33:55,480 --> 00:33:57,280
You still remember my birthday?

796
00:33:58,680 --> 00:33:59,740
Are you kidding me?

797
00:34:05,520 --> 00:34:06,650
What does this mean?

798
00:34:06,720 --> 00:34:08,120
There's 500,000 on the card.

799
00:34:08,120 --> 00:34:09,600
Pay off your loan first.

800
00:34:10,320 --> 00:34:11,920
How did you know I have a loan?

801
00:34:15,600 --> 00:34:16,600
Look, is this you?

802
00:34:24,159 --> 00:34:26,000
Where did you find this list?

803
00:34:26,000 --> 00:34:27,880
How did this get leaked?

804
00:34:30,840 --> 00:34:33,239
Didn't I tell you my dad came looking for me?

805
00:34:33,320 --> 00:34:35,199
His surname is Wan. Wan Jiliang.

806
00:34:35,480 --> 00:34:36,239
Wan Jiliang?

807
00:34:37,880 --> 00:34:39,940
Why does this name sound so familiar?

808
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:42,530
The boss of Wangang is also named Wan Jiliang.

809
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:45,170
Wan Jiliang is your dad?

810
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:50,040
Then, Dali, you're set for life!

811
00:34:51,040 --> 00:34:51,760
Then, from now on,

812
00:34:51,760 --> 00:34:52,760
will you have to change your surname to Wan?

813
00:34:52,760 --> 00:34:54,000
Will you be called Wan Zhuoli?

814
00:34:54,000 --> 00:34:55,239
That's for the public.

815
00:34:55,239 --> 00:34:57,760
Between us, you can still call me Dali.

816
00:34:58,040 --> 00:34:59,240
I'm still your Dali.

817
00:35:00,320 --> 00:35:01,120
Well, Dali,

818
00:35:01,520 --> 00:35:02,520
this is too much.

819
00:35:02,520 --> 00:35:03,400
I can't accept this.

820
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:05,840
When will I ever be able to pay back 500,000?

821
00:35:06,480 --> 00:35:08,040
Who asked you to pay it back?

822
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:09,080
Well, your loss

823
00:35:09,080 --> 00:35:11,140
actually has something to do with me.

824
00:35:11,480 --> 00:35:13,210
I have to take responsibility.

825
00:35:14,320 --> 00:35:15,760
This is too much.

826
00:35:15,760 --> 00:35:17,880
Just consider it an advance on your salary.

827
00:35:17,880 --> 00:35:18,800
It's only a year's worth.

828
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:20,040
Are you kidding me?

829
00:35:20,040 --> 00:35:21,880
Who makes 500,000 a year?

830
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:22,840
No, Huzi.

831
00:35:23,520 --> 00:35:25,560
I really want you to come and help me.

832
00:35:26,680 --> 00:35:28,760
Haven't you always wanted to get rich?

833
00:35:28,760 --> 00:35:31,220
This is such a great opportunity for you now.

834
00:35:31,560 --> 00:35:33,440
Even if you don't think about yourself,

835
00:35:33,440 --> 00:35:35,440
you should think about Sister Pang.

836
00:35:35,840 --> 00:35:37,000
How old is she?

837
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:40,800
I want to be good to my mom now, but I don't even have the chance.

838
00:35:49,640 --> 00:35:53,400
I really don't want you to have this regret too.

839
00:35:56,240 --> 00:35:56,760
Come on.

840
00:36:07,600 --> 00:36:11,600
Happy birthday!

841
00:36:14,240 --> 00:36:15,440
Everyone's here.

842
00:36:15,440 --> 00:36:17,640
My uncle is stunned.

843
00:36:17,880 --> 00:36:20,410
Come and take the seat of honor, birthday boy.

844
00:36:22,240 --> 00:36:23,000
Brother Hu.

845
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:23,600
Come on.

846
00:36:23,600 --> 00:36:25,480
This is a gift we picked out for you together,

847
00:36:25,480 --> 00:36:26,360
little tiger.

848
00:36:27,040 --> 00:36:28,960
Today is my uncle's birthday.

849
00:36:28,960 --> 00:36:30,880
Can I be bold and propose a toast first?

850
00:36:30,880 --> 00:36:31,520
Go ahead.

851
00:36:31,920 --> 00:36:34,520
I wish my uncle a roaring success

852
00:36:35,040 --> 00:36:36,360
and a great new journey.

853
00:36:36,360 --> 00:36:37,520
Like a tiger with wings.

854
00:36:37,520 --> 00:36:38,480
Full of vigor and vitality.

855
00:36:38,480 --> 00:36:40,200
I'll propose a serious toast.

856
00:36:40,200 --> 00:36:42,960
Today, my words were a bit harsh.

857
00:36:43,720 --> 00:36:44,980
Don't take it to heart.

858
00:36:45,040 --> 00:36:46,520
Brother Hu is broad-minded.

859
00:36:46,520 --> 00:36:47,880
You won't hold it against me.

860
00:36:47,880 --> 00:36:48,560
As for me,

861
00:36:48,560 --> 00:36:50,920
I've also done some deep self-reflection.

862
00:36:50,920 --> 00:36:52,720
Indeed, sometimes when I take on cases,

863
00:36:52,720 --> 00:36:54,800
I'm just too impulsive.

864
00:36:55,120 --> 00:36:56,320
I don't consider everyone's feelings,

865
00:36:56,320 --> 00:36:57,680
especially yours.

866
00:36:58,000 --> 00:36:58,600
I'm sorry.

867
00:36:59,240 --> 00:37:00,400
From now on,

868
00:37:00,640 --> 00:37:01,520
I think

869
00:37:01,520 --> 00:37:03,250
we should take on more big cases

870
00:37:03,560 --> 00:37:05,800
to boost our law firm's profits.

871
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:06,400
Right?

872
00:37:06,400 --> 00:37:07,600
Good.

873
00:37:08,000 --> 00:37:08,800
I'll drink up.

874
00:37:09,600 --> 00:37:10,600
I'll drink up too.

875
00:37:11,440 --> 00:37:12,920
Let's hurry up to the next part.

876
00:37:12,920 --> 00:37:13,680
Next part.

877
00:37:13,680 --> 00:37:15,480
Light the candles for Brother Hu.

878
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:15,810
Okay.

879
00:37:16,120 --> 00:37:17,440
Make a wish.

880
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:19,680
You look handsome in this hat.

881
00:37:22,960 --> 00:37:23,400
Light the candles.

882
00:37:23,400 --> 00:37:24,200
Wait a minute.

883
00:37:25,440 --> 00:37:27,100
Since everyone is here today,

884
00:37:29,160 --> 00:37:30,620
I'd like to say a few words.

885
00:37:32,880 --> 00:37:37,040
Thank you all for taking care of me for over a year.

886
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:40,920
Meeting you all

887
00:37:42,680 --> 00:37:44,720
is the luckiest thing in my life.

888
00:37:58,040 --> 00:37:59,040
Old Squad Leader,

889
00:38:00,040 --> 00:38:04,000
there aren't many people I truly admire,

890
00:38:05,000 --> 00:38:06,930
but you are definitely one of them.

891
00:38:07,720 --> 00:38:08,400
Miaomiao,

892
00:38:08,960 --> 00:38:11,760
even though you always argue with me,

893
00:38:14,120 --> 00:38:15,200
in my heart,

894
00:38:16,360 --> 00:38:17,820
you are like my own sister.

895
00:38:18,560 --> 00:38:19,080
Nephew,

896
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:21,920
we are family, so there's no need for formalities.

897
00:38:21,920 --> 00:38:23,480
You'll definitely pass the bar exam.

898
00:38:23,480 --> 00:38:24,280
Of course.

899
00:38:27,480 --> 00:38:28,280
Drink slowly.

900
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:29,320
You lack alcohol dehydrogenase.

901
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:30,240
If you pass out later,

902
00:38:30,240 --> 00:38:31,700
who's going to help you up?

903
00:38:33,400 --> 00:38:34,130
Sister Long,

904
00:38:34,160 --> 00:38:36,760
I have to toast you personally with this glass.

905
00:38:37,520 --> 00:38:38,720
In my heart,

906
00:38:39,480 --> 00:38:42,200
on this street of lawyers,

907
00:38:43,520 --> 00:38:46,000
no, in all of Leyang City,

908
00:38:48,520 --> 00:38:49,850
you are the best lawyer.

909
00:38:50,400 --> 00:38:52,360
You have passion,

910
00:38:53,160 --> 00:38:54,040
ideals,

911
00:38:54,600 --> 00:38:55,600
and persistence.

912
00:38:56,480 --> 00:38:59,680
You have many things that I don't have.

913
00:39:00,680 --> 00:39:01,640
I believe

914
00:39:02,760 --> 00:39:04,800
under your leadership,

915
00:39:06,040 --> 00:39:08,700
our law firm will definitely be RISING JUSTICE.

916
00:39:09,720 --> 00:39:11,640
You're making me emotional.

917
00:39:12,560 --> 00:39:13,160
Don't.

918
00:39:18,480 --> 00:39:19,160
I'm sorry.

919
00:39:22,600 --> 00:39:23,530
I want to resign.

920
00:39:36,120 --> 00:39:37,960
Uncle, making this joke now

921
00:39:37,960 --> 00:39:38,720
isn't funny.

922
00:39:38,720 --> 00:39:39,560
What a terrible joke.

923
00:39:39,560 --> 00:39:40,840
Brother Hu, try another one.

924
00:39:40,840 --> 00:39:41,700
I'm not joking.

925
00:39:43,440 --> 00:39:44,840
I have a childhood friend

926
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:46,640
who went abroad when we were young.

927
00:39:46,640 --> 00:39:48,440
He came back a couple of days ago.

928
00:39:48,520 --> 00:39:49,960
He opened a bathhouse

929
00:39:50,160 --> 00:39:51,490
and asked me to help out.

930
00:39:52,400 --> 00:39:53,280
It makes sense.

931
00:39:53,280 --> 00:39:55,560
The bathhouse is my old profession,

932
00:39:55,560 --> 00:39:56,280
right?

933
00:39:59,160 --> 00:40:00,000
Beihu,

934
00:40:00,160 --> 00:40:01,920
such a major decision,

935
00:40:02,440 --> 00:40:03,960
won't you reconsider?

936
00:40:05,080 --> 00:40:06,360
Look at me,

937
00:40:08,160 --> 00:40:09,420
I'm not young anymore.

938
00:40:10,400 --> 00:40:13,360
Before, going out to find clients

939
00:40:15,360 --> 00:40:16,960
was something I could make do with.

940
00:40:16,960 --> 00:40:17,760
But,

941
00:40:20,240 --> 00:40:22,770
I'm just not cut out for the legal profession.

942
00:40:23,560 --> 00:40:25,400
I bought so many books on criminal law,

943
00:40:25,400 --> 00:40:27,800
but I've only read about ten pages in total.

944
00:40:29,440 --> 00:40:30,560
And now,

945
00:40:30,720 --> 00:40:32,580
our law firm is on the right track,

946
00:40:33,240 --> 00:40:34,680
and we don't lack cases.

947
00:40:35,080 --> 00:40:36,240
What I can do

948
00:40:37,120 --> 00:40:38,520
is getting less and less.

949
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:49,460
Have you made up your mind?

950
00:40:50,480 --> 00:40:52,080
You're definitely leaving?

951
00:40:57,280 --> 00:40:58,560
Here it comes.

952
00:40:58,600 --> 00:41:01,200
Hot longevity noodles are here.

953
00:41:01,720 --> 00:41:02,280
It's okay.

954
00:41:02,280 --> 00:41:03,560
You just sit.

955
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:05,240
Thanks to you guys.

956
00:41:05,240 --> 00:41:07,880
You've helped Hu a lot recently.

957
00:41:08,800 --> 00:41:09,600
What's wrong?

958
00:41:11,120 --> 00:41:11,720
Nothing.

959
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:14,880
Sister Pang, it's his birthday.

960
00:41:14,880 --> 00:41:15,920
We were just chatting,

961
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:17,120
and he got emotional.

962
00:41:18,360 --> 00:41:19,080
Brother Hu,

963
00:41:20,120 --> 00:41:21,880
today is your big day.

964
00:41:22,560 --> 00:41:25,280
On behalf of our law firm, I wish you

965
00:41:26,960 --> 00:41:28,200
wealth,

966
00:41:29,160 --> 00:41:30,400
success,

967
00:41:30,960 --> 00:41:32,040
good health,

968
00:41:33,520 --> 00:41:34,720
and happiness.

969
00:41:39,360 --> 00:41:40,080
Nephew,

970
00:41:41,200 --> 00:41:43,060
light the candles and make a wish.

971
00:41:55,440 --> 00:41:56,160
I hope...

972
00:41:58,200 --> 00:42:00,080
I hope everyone is doing well.

973
00:42:05,400 --> 00:42:06,400
It won't blow out.

974
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:09,160
I...

975
00:42:12,120 --> 00:42:13,050
I drank too fast.

976
00:42:15,920 --> 00:42:17,760
It went straight to my head.

977
00:42:18,200 --> 00:42:19,000
I can't take it.

978
00:42:19,000 --> 00:42:22,680
I'm going back to lie down for a while.

979
00:42:23,240 --> 00:42:24,640
Otherwise, I'll embarrass myself.

980
00:42:24,640 --> 00:42:24,960
Well...

981
00:42:24,960 --> 00:42:26,280
You guys eat.

982
00:42:30,760 --> 00:42:31,600
This kid.

983
00:42:32,040 --> 00:42:33,170
I'll go check on him.

984
00:42:34,280 --> 00:42:35,280
You go ahead and eat.
